$MDESC::Type = "Combat for Flags";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Combat for Flags" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> An unexplored desert world" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
		 "\n\n<f2>This map is for skilled players only. The point of this map is to duel, and players who lack skills generally do not like this map. "@
		 "Yes, I am challenging you to test yourself on this map. No mortars, no deployed defenses, nothing but combat armor and you.\n"@
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> face each other for control of the dunes of a desert world. "@
		 "The battle is taking place amongst the ancient ruins of an extinct people. Neither tribe has a permanent base, "@
		 "instead each have set up their camps in small pyramidal buildings. Each pyramid houses the tribal flags. "@
		 "Grab the enemy tribe's flag and bring it back to the pyramid, touching it to your own flag to capture it. "@
		 "Victory will be achieved by the team that successfully captures their opponent's flag six times. "@
		 "\n\nHonor is achieved by the slaughter of your foes. Have no mercy, revel in the death of the enemy! "@
		 "May their screams be music unto you and the sands run red with their blood!"@
		 "\n\nThis Mission has been design to run within the TRIBAL COMBAT system. Anti-TK TRAITOR code has been enable. "@
		 "Anyone who Team Kills shall be switched to TEAM TRAITOR.";

